  "steps": [
    "Filling: beat the cream cheese until smooth, mix in the white chocolate, scoop 20 flattened 2-tsp discs onto parchment and freeze.",
    "Jam: cook the raspberries over medium-low heat for 5 minutes, mashing, then press through a sieve. Whisk in the sugar and cook 15–17 minutes until thick. Chill.",
    "Heat the oven to 175 °C. Whisk the flour, baking powder, baking soda and salt.",
    "Cream the butter and sugar until fluffy, beat in the egg and vanilla, then mix in the dry ingredients.",
    "Layer the dough with the jam in quarters and fold just enough to leave pockets of jam.",
    "Scoop 20 portions, wrap each around a frozen cheesecake disc so it's fully covered, and roll in sugar.",
    "Bake 6 at a time for 11–12 minutes. Cool 10 minutes on the sheet, then on a rack."
  ],
